.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/3410698fdd1dd489e4865028b9658e9e.webm?t=1753337009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/3410698fdd1dd489e4865028b9658e9e.mp4?t=1753337009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
